    "ja": {
      "trackName": "Partywheel - Quick Party Games",
      "description": "One spin picks what you play together next. Partywheel brings 14 group games to Apple TV, iPhone and iPad, with no player names to enter and no ads.\n\nThe cropped wheel reveals your next game. Its rules stay on screen until you spin again, so you can jump straight into playing together.\n\nAll 14 classics are included for free. A one-time purchase of Partywheel Premium lets you disable individual games and add, edit or delete your own games with a title, emoji and description.\n\nWith iCloud, your personal game selection syncs across your devices. On iPhone and iPad, you can also save your own games locally without iCloud. Editing on Apple TV requires an available iCloud connection; games already saved there can also be played offline.\n\nOne Premium purchase works on iPhone, iPad and Apple TV using the same Apple Account for purchases. If you previously purchased the ad-free option, Premium is included without another purchase.\n\nThe interface and classic games are available in English, German, French and Spanish. Your own game descriptions stay just as you wrote them. Sound and supported haptics can be switched off separately.",
      "releaseNotes": "- A new native interface for iPhone, iPad and Apple TV.\n- A cropped wheel with room for game titles and rules.\n- All 14 classics, now without ads.\n- Premium: create your own games and customize your selection.\n- Sync your personal game selection with iCloud.\n- Previous ad-free purchases unlock Premium.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/partywheel-quick-party-games/id6463636342?uo=4",
